  "aerocali.ponder.thruster_additional.header": "关于推进器的补充信息",
  "aerocali.ponder.thruster_functionality.text_1": "这就是推进器",
  "aerocali.ponder.thruster_functionality.text_2": "向其中泵入岩浆之类的燃料……",
  "aerocali.ponder.thruster_functionality.text_3": "再用红石为其供能……",
  "aerocali.ponder.thruster_functionality.text_4": "它就会输出推力！",
  "aerocali.ponder.thruster_upgrading.text_1": "通常，推进器消耗燃料输出普通推力。",
  "aerocali.ponder.thruster_upgrading.text_2": "手持离子化热力构件右键点击它……",
  "aerocali.ponder.thruster_upgrading.text_3": "推进器就会变成离子推进器，推力翻倍，并且改用 FE 而非燃料",
  "aerocali.ponder.generator_functionality.text_1": "这就是发电机。",
  "aerocali.ponder.generator_functionality.text_2": "通入转速后，它就会产生 FE",
  "aerocali.ponder.generator_functionality.text_3": "转速越高，发电机每刻产生的 FE 越多，上限为 15 FE/刻",
  "aerocali.ponder.tracker_functionality.text_1": "这就是导航追踪器。",
  "aerocali.ponder.tracker_functionality.text_2": "它需要上方有一根转速至少为 30 的传动轴",
  "aerocali.ponder.tracker_functionality.text_3": "以及下方有一个导航台才能工作。",
  "aerocali.ponder.tracker_functionality.text_4": "它的主要功能是测量自身与目标点之间的距离",
  "aerocali.ponder.tracker_functionality.text_5": "输入导航罗盘后，追踪器会依据与目标的距离输出红石信号。",
  "aerocali.ponder.tracker_functionality.text_6": "追踪器还会立刻把罗盘传给下方的导航台。",
  "aerocali.ponder.tracker_functionality.text_7": "追踪器还有 4 种其它模式，当前是标准模式。",
  "aerocali.ponder.tracker_functionality.text_8": "某些模式需要给追踪器一个命名牌才能正常工作。",
  "aerocali.ponder.tracker_functionality.text_9": "这些模式是 §3“追踪最近的指定名称子层级”§f、§3“追踪最近的非指定名称子层级”§f 以及 §3“追踪玩家”",
  "aerocali.ponder.tracker_functionality.text_10": "这里的命名牌用于标识子层级的名称（取自飞船上的铭牌）或玩家名称。",
  "aerocali.ponder.tracker_functionality.text_11": "选择其它 4 种模式之一时，目标方向由导航台输出",
  "aerocali.ponder.anvil_functionality.text_1": "这就是机械铁砧。",
  "aerocali.ponder.anvil_functionality.text_2": "依据输入的转速……",
  "aerocali.ponder.anvil_functionality.text_3": "铁砧会改变自身质量！",
  "aerocali.ponder.anvil_functionality.text_4": "铁砧可以把质量改成与输入转速完全相同的数值，例如：",
  "aerocali.ponder.anvil_functionality.text_5": "16 KPG",
  "aerocali.ponder.anvil_functionality.text_6": "32 KPG",
  "aerocali.ponder.anvil_functionality.text_7": "64 KPG",
  "aerocali.ponder.anvil_functionality.text_8": "最高上限为 256 KPG",
  "aerocali.ponder.cable_functionality.text_1": "这就是电子线缆。",
  "aerocali.ponder.cable_functionality.text_2": "它用于把 FE 从 A 点传输到 B 点",
  "aerocali.ponder.cable_functionality.text_3": "当它通电时……",
  "aerocali.ponder.cable_functionality.text_4": "它就会亮起！",
  "aerocali.ponder.cable_functionality.text_5": "当旁边有其它线缆时，它会传输能量",
  "aerocali.ponder.nozzle_cover_functionality.text_1": "当推进器的推力颜色让你觉得不方便时……",
  "aerocali.ponder.nozzle_cover_functionality.text_2": "你可以给推进器装上染色的喷口盖来改变它的颜色！",
  "aerocali.ponder.thruster_additional.text_1": "推进器最后一项便利功能：手持扳手按住 Shift 左键点击它时……",
  "aerocali.ponder.thruster_additional.text_2": "……推进器将不再产生声音与粒子效果！",
